# stb-adsorb site positions (.dat) -- in-plane fractional (a, b)
# coordinates relative to the LATTICE_A/LATTICE_B vectors below (Ang);
# height/z is controlled separately by --height/--height-sweep on the
# run that reads this file back. Each 'number' matches its label in
# adsorption_sites.png. '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.
